WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
(jazz house band)
(audience cheers)

00:00:12.356 --> 00:00:15.021
- Oh my goodness.
- Hello!

00:00:15.021 --> 00:00:17.370
- What a beautiful studio!
- I know, we're excited.

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:18.649
Thank you.

00:00:18.649 --> 00:00:20.656
- They told me they didn't
have money for nice studios.

00:00:20.656 --> 00:00:23.280
- (laughs) I love being
in this building with you.

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:24.120
You are.
- It's a great building.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.950
- I have to say this, you
were the very first person

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:27.810
when we announced that we
were coming to New York,

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:29.760
he sent me a, like, handwritten card.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:30.593
Like.
- Yeah.

00:00:30.593 --> 00:00:32.010
- Saying, "Welcome to 30 Rock.

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:33.360
I'll show you around the commissary."

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:34.710
Which, by the way, has really good food.

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:36.180
- It's a excellent commissary!

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:37.013
- Yes.

00:00:37.013 --> 00:00:38.289
- That was the first thing
I was gonna tell you.

00:00:38.289 --> 00:00:39.649
- It's, like, when you said it in a card,

00:00:39.649 --> 00:00:40.894
and you brought up food, I was like,

00:00:40.894 --> 00:00:41.803
"I don't know."
- Yeah.

00:00:41.803 --> 00:00:44.010
- 'Cause, like, a cafeteria
can, it can be suspect.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.840
- It could be. I started here in 2001,

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:48.480
and the cafeteria in 2001 was a dump.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:50.100
- Okay, okay. I came at the right time.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.690
- And, they rebuilt the commissary.

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:52.523
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:52.523 --> 00:00:53.580
- And, I take it to the streets.

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:54.990
I brag about it everywhere.
- Oh my God.

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:56.646
It's so good, yeah.

00:00:56.646 --> 00:00:57.948
Yeah.
- Yeah. It's really great.

00:00:57.948 --> 00:00:59.101
- I love the banana smoothie.

00:00:59.101 --> 00:01:00.517
- You do have to pay for the food.

00:01:00.517 --> 00:01:01.640
I've heard about you at previous places,

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:03.113
that you, there's an assumption

00:01:03.113 --> 00:01:04.200
because you're Kelly Clarkson,
you can just take the food

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:05.926
and walk right out.
- Yes.

00:01:05.926 --> 00:01:06.759
- But, I do need you to stop.
- Well, I'm here now, 30 Rock,

00:01:06.759 --> 00:01:07.629
so, I'm just. I want free food.

00:01:07.629 --> 00:01:08.462
(both laugh)

